title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1, CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD=plain): a card without a level control: SOFT takes the full width, Settings without Input level and Auto gain
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD plain
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
expect notext "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
shot plain-card
key s
wait 500
expect text "Record timer"
expect notext "Input level"
expect notext "Auto gain (card)"
shot plain-settings
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
